stone.js API stable (terrain agent):
  rockMaterial(opts)      natural limestone rock (cliffs, boulders, outcrops)
  limestoneMaterial(opts) dressed / cut limestone (ruins blocks, walls, paving)
  createRock(rng, opts)   procedural boulder BufferGeometry (position, normal, aCavity), shapes: boulder|block|slab|pillar|mass|pebble
  STONE_GLSL              shared GLSL (stShade / stBumpNormal) for custom materials
opts: tint, scale, moss, lichen, streaks, strata, ochre, wetBelow, bump, variation, roughness, side
